  "post_content": "<p><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/2014/03/IMG_6371.jpg\" style=\"width: 480px; height: 320px\" /></p>\n<p>Tales ha acogido la tarde de este s&aacute;bado, 15 de marzo, la III Trobada de Tambors i Bombos, en la que han participado formaciones de toda la provincia de Castell&oacute;n. Han desfilado por el casco antiguo y han actuado en la plaza del Olivo.</p>\n<p></p>\n<div class=\"galeria-ngg\" style=\"display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:8px;\"><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/tamborstales14/img_6237.jpg\" alt=\"img_6237\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/tamborstales14/img_6238.jpg\" alt=\"img_6238\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/tamborstales14/img_6239.jpg\" alt=\"img_6239\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/tamborstales14/img_6241.jpg\" alt=\"img_6241\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/tamborstales14/img_6242.jpg\" alt=\"img_6242\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/tamborstales14/img_6243.jpg\" alt=\"img_6243\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/tamborstales14/img_6244.jpg\" alt=\"img_6244\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/tamborstales14/img_6245.jpg\" alt=\"img_6245\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/tamborstales14/img_6246.jpg\" alt=\"img_6246\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/tamborstales14/img_6247.jpg\" alt=\"img_6247\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\